WEBVTT

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:09.490
Bouncing a ball
so very round

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:14.670
It is so warm

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:21.570
Whose (Whose)

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:27.830
You? (Me?)

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:34.170
Me? (You?)

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:42.610
Balls fill up the red world

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.500
Miyu... please die...

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.230
...for my sake...

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:03.250
Chisato is... a Shinma...

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:04.740
Did it surprise you?

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:10.120
Father... Mother...

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:28.020
Father and Mother
are dead now.

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:29.920
You killed my brother, too.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.360
Are you going
to kill me, too, Miyu?

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:35.710
I don't know.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:38.280
You can't do it?

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.140
That's understandable,
because we are friends.

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:44.280
But, Miyu...

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:46.140
...I'm not going to die...

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:48.690
...because it is you,
Miyu, who's gonna die.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.480
You won't be able to break...

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:21.080
...the chains of destiny
fighting like that.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:22.920
Why do you target Miyu?

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.320
Because we are birds.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:29.320
We are destined to defeat
the Guardian in every generation.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.940
Miyu is simply
obeying her destiny, too.

00:02:33.070 --> 00:02:34.170
I know.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.940
All of us Shinmas
are probably that way.

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:38.600
Aren't you the same way?

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:39.870
You, Western Shinma?

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:42.780
I don't need
to answer you.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.770
That's correct.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.720
There is no answer
to begin with.

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:06.720
They are all spilled
and scattered.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.910
Everything in your hands
is the same way.

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:14.270
Someday they will
all spill and vanish...

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.070
What did you
come here for?

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.190
Don't be a brat.

00:03:19.350 --> 00:03:20.320
Here.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:21.750
I don't want it.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:24.020
Come on, just take one bite.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:27.660
Bitter...

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.050
No wonder...
because it is a human soul.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.060
You ate one!

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.500
You've finally eaten a soul!

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:41.630
You can't escape anymore!

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:44.430
Mother! Mother!

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:51.970
Father came back earlier.

00:03:52.550 --> 00:03:53.520
Mother...

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.570
But he took off soon again.

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:58.990
He is always like that.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.410
He never stays home.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:03.490
He's really busy.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:12.660
Winds call your father.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.490
When winds blow,
birds get noisy.

00:04:16.970 --> 00:04:18.430
No matter how often
you shoo birds away...

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:20.280
...they come right back.

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.330
There are
no birds, Mother.

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.650
Your father
left some money.

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.250
He told me
to buy you something.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.180
I'll buy you a kimono.

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:40.620
Miyu, which do you want,
a red one or white one?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.630
I don't want kimonos...

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:46.590
So... this is
your house, Miyu.

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:49.470
- I've never seen it before.
- Who are you?

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:51.860
Have you forgotten?

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:53.340
I'm your friend.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.980
I have no friends.

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:57.520
Why?

00:04:57.980 --> 00:04:59.670
Miyu, you want
a friend, don't you?

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:01.450
That's why I came here.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.070
I don't want any friends.

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:05.660
That's a lie.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.160
Nothing remains
in your hands.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:48.070
There was an egg
inside me...

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.990
...and inside the egg
was my true self sleeping.

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:55.590
After I met you, Miyu,
the egg woke up.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.300
That's not you, Chisato.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:58.740
Why?

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.470
Why aren't you
happy for me?

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:03.070
The egg was waiting for you,
Miyu, for a long time.

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:05.010
Is it because of me?

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.270
I didn't notice because
the egg was asleep?

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:10.210
That's right.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:15.210
I'm so happy, because
I can remain a child forever.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.330
As a Shinma...

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:19.790
So what?

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:21.920
Those who were born
out of the darkness...

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.360
...must return
to the darkness.

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:26.620
They cannot
remain in this world.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.790
That's not so.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.370
All it takes is to simply turn
this world into total darkness.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.360
When it's covered
with black wings...

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:36.140
...the light is
no longer necessary.

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:42.250
The darkness has not been
cast away from this world.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:45.110
It is sleeping
inside people.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.440
When each darkness
breaks through its shell...

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:52.690
...the entire world
forms a giant egg...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.270
...and becomes
True Darkness...

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.530
...a Giant Darkness...

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:58.950
...a Warm Darkness...

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.900
...a World of Shinma.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:12.610
The real truth is, no one
really wants to grow up.

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:18.010
All we need to do is wake up
and remember the Darkness.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:20.390
That's not
an awakening.

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.000
A blade doesn't hurt me.

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.890
Claws of birds are meant
to tear up their prey.

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.200
Miyu won't be torn up
by such things.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:40.070
Right.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.030
That's why it took so long...

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.710
...to hatch the strongest
Shinma from an egg.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:47.580
Special powers
are instilled in her.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.050
What do you mean?

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.550
The Guardian's flames are
the reflection of her feelings.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:59.260
Aren't they?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:00.820
That's why...

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:03.460
...she can't shoot them
at the strongest Shinma.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:04.770
Miyu!

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:16.310
You remember
this place, don't you?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.780
This is where you
killed my brother, Miyu.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:23.700
I simply sent a stray Shinma
back to the darkness.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:25.390
That's nonsense!

00:08:25.950 --> 00:08:27.380
He was my brother!

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.140
He didn't have to wake up.

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:31.710
But he did
because of you, Miyu!

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.090
It's your fault, Miyu!

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:36.030
You loved your brother.

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:37.640
Yes.

00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:42.730
I was determined to become
his bride when I grew up!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.560
But, Chisato...
you'll never grow up.

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:48.310
That's all the more
reason it was good!

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:51.310
I could have
dreamed about it forever!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.120
It was my dream!

00:08:53.520 --> 00:08:54.920
Miyu, you destroyed it!

00:08:55.920 --> 00:08:56.890
So... Miyu...

00:08:57.350 --> 00:08:58.310
...die.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:19.690
Stray Shinma...
to the darkness!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.450
Chisato... good-bye...

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.000
It doesn't work on me.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.840
- Larva!
- Miyu!

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:31.520
Larva!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:39.860
It's no use.

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:41.580
Miyu's servant?

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:43.510
Is he going to die, too?

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:46.760
It's time
for farewell, Miyu.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.160
This is what it means
to be friends, right?

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.200
Yes. Because you want
to die, too, Miyu.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.320
I'm not sure...

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:19.560
I'm taking
your power, Miyu.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:23.750
Your blood will live
inside me... forever...

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.660
All right?

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:39.980
Miyu.

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:45.780
Are you going to die?

00:11:46.520 --> 00:11:47.510
I really don't care.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:49.680
That's disappointing.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:53.720
I had decided that I would
be the one to defeat you.

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:56.430
I intended to
wait for you...

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:01.270
I never imagined I would hear
the Guardian say such a thing.

00:12:02.270 --> 00:12:04.230
It's a shame that you were
defeated by a mere stray Shinma.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:07.200
Do you mean to tell me...

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.150
...that I was defeated
by such a weak opponent?

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:14.540
I don't exist
to win or to lose.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:17.440
I exist for my destiny...
as simple as that.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.920
If you are just being
shoved around by destiny...

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:23.080
...you are no different
than stray Shinma.

00:12:23.790 --> 00:12:27.050
Is that your
true self, Miyu?

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:30.370
I am here... forever...

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:33.930
I have been
and I always will...

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:39.270
My father and other Shinma
Protectors made efforts in vain.

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:43.980
But I'm sure you don't
care about that, either.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:45.650
You're right.

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:48.270
Those might have
been dreams, too.

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:53.120
Such a Guardian should die.
I don't care.

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:54.890
Do whatever you like.

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:04.840
You...

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.370
Don't you remember me?

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:12.070
Uh... yes.
But... you are alive?

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:13.540
I died.

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:16.480
You haven't
forgotten that, have you?

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.510
Have you come
to remind me?

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.470
You called me.

00:13:21.420 --> 00:13:23.250
I had no intention to.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:26.850
Yes... you want to go back.

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.250
That's why
you came here.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.420
That's not true. I just...

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:36.430
Mother...

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:38.970
Your father is mad.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.870
Mother, was my father
a Guardian?

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:45.440
Is that why he died?

00:13:46.370 --> 00:13:47.840
He was a magnificent man.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.900
Your father didn't pay
much attention to you.

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:53.880
That's why he was great.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.180
You've grown so much.

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.250
You need a kimono.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.130
Your father said so.

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:12.160
Miyu, which one do you want,
a red kimono or a white kimono?

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:14.860
I don't know.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.130
Go see the river.

00:14:33.150 --> 00:14:34.380
Looks like blood.

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:36.820
Flowers are flowing.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.700
Is that you
when you were little, Miyu?

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:46.100
Shiina, do you know what a red
kimono and a white kimono mean?

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:48.670
It's been a while
since I heard that.

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:51.000
A red kimono
is for a prisoner...

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:54.860
...and a white kimono
is for a dead person.

00:14:55.210 --> 00:14:57.070
It means either
be captured or die.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:00.790
Either be
captured or die...

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:24.900
Everyone is blown
away by the wind...

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:26.760
...and turned into
grains of sand.

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:43.950
Right... I am alive
because I am dead... am I not?

00:15:44.890 --> 00:15:46.380
Are you going
to cross the river?

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:49.130
No. I...

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:07.380
I told you. You can't
hurt me with a blade.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.340
This will finish you!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:34.900
What... happened?

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:40.310
Miyu's blood is flowing inside me,
and her blood is burning.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.650
That's... impossible...

00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:45.710
I didn't want to use it...

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:49.150
...because it is the proof
of my only defeat.

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:54.120
But if Miyu tries to escape
from the chains of destiny...

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.530
...it is me
who terminates her life.

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.330
Until then...

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:01.560
You are a bird, too.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:04.800
A despicable... bird...

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:15.610
Even if it's true, I have
nails to cut off destiny.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:17.870
And Miyu's blood is...

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:19.080
...still burning...

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:29.770
Miyu.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.190
It was fun
getting to know you.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:33.890
I'll never forget you.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:37.270
But, Miyu, you are not
needed here anymore.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.380
Bye-bye.

00:17:42.340 --> 00:17:43.310
Miyu!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:51.570
I can't die.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.050
It's already summer.

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.000
We need to get going.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:21.880
The class is starting.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.080
There are no classes.

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:26.010
Don't say such silly things.

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:29.080
Time has stopped.
See?

00:18:29.390 --> 00:18:32.290
That cloud is not moving
and there is no wind blowing.

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:38.760
It just means
we have beautiful weather.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:40.660
That's fine with me.

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:44.970
I will stay here
like this forever.

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.770
It might be nice if we
could stay like this forever.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.280
Now you are
being silly, too, Hisae?

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:54.810
Don't you think
it would be nice...

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.870
...if we didn't have to see...

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.640
...suffering and the dark side
of things?

00:18:59.050 --> 00:19:00.020
That's right.

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:02.790
I'm happiest right now.

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:08.090
I have my big brother,
Yukari, Hisae, and...

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.510
I'm getting kind of sleepy.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:19.710
Get up, Chisato.

00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:20.800
The class is starting.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:24.140
There is
no such thing anymore.

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:27.420
I'm falling asleep.

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:33.390
Chisato. Chisato!

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.400
You are having a dream,
aren't you, Chisato?

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:49.930
You can stay here.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.380
You can remain
a child in my world.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:59.810
There are a lot
of friends here.

00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:06.370
Good night...

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:16.580
Bouncing a ball
so very round

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:21.300
My heart goes out

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:28.770
Whose (Whose)

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:35.300
You? (Me?)

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:41.210
Me? (You?)

00:20:41.820 --> 00:20:49.450
I see the dream
tumbling down

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:56.940
Whose (Whose)

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:03.270
You? (Me?)

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:09.490
Me? (You?)

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:16.560
The ball rolls over

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:23.400
Where are you going?
(I don't know)

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:29.670
What are you chasing?
(I don't know)

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:34.860
What do you want?

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:42.680
(I don't want anything)

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:55.320
We need to go,
Larva and Shiina.

00:21:56.530 --> 00:21:58.790
Stray Shinma are waiting.
